From: Wisnuu <wisnuandrian325@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 13:43:29 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] feat(zed): add Build Locally toolbar for .plan.md files

Auto-open *.plan.md in markdown preview, expose model selector + Build
Locally on the quick action bar, and submit /go <plan> into the Agent
Panel. Also treat omp as supporting additional directories.
